CATEGORIES:Law,Politics
DESCRIPTION:Faculty of Law\nTopics: Law\, Politics\nDetails: https://www.la
 w.cam.ac.uk/events/legal-and-political-theology-colloquium\nSign-up needed
 \nDate/time: \n\n Saturday 23 January 2027 \n\n 10:00am to 5:00pm\n\n Loca
 tion: \n\n Jesus College\n\n Webb Library\n\n This colloquium explores key
